## Modelo de DB a crear

```python
class ConversationMessage(SQLModel, table=True):
    __tablename__ = "conversation_messages"

    id: Optional[int] = Field(default=None, primary_key=True)
    lead_id: int = Field(foreign_key="leads.id", index=True)
    role: str = Field(max_length=20)       # "user" | "assistant"
    content: str = Field(max_length=2000)
    platform: str = Field(default="tiktok", max_length=20)
    created_at: datetime = Field(default_factory=_now)
```

## Endpoint a crear

```python
# routers/agent.py
@router.post("/process-reply")
async def process_reply(
    lead_id: int,
    reply_text: str,
    background_tasks: BackgroundTasks,
):
    """
    Recibe evento reply_received del monitor y dispara el agente.
    El agente responde en background para no bloquear el polling del monitor.
    """
    background_tasks.add_task(agent_service.process_reply, lead_id, reply_text)
    return {"status": "processing", "lead_id": lead_id}
```

